    "norm": "Verifies that the deprecation handler was invoked exactly once (for {@code expectedOption}) when a deprecation was expected, or not at all otherwise, then clears the handler's log for the next check. @param deprecationExpected {@code true} if a deprecation should have been logged. @param handler the list the deprecation handler appends to. @param expectedOption the option expected to have triggered the log; may be {@code null} when none is expected."
   },
